WEBVTT

00:20:59.397 --> 00:21:04.063
what lessons can a country like ours learn

00:21:04.097 --> 00:21:07.430
from some of the lower income nations

00:21:07.463 --> 00:21:10.697
that are already beginning
to tackle climate change?

00:21:10.730 --> 00:21:13.330
JK: Well, I think one
of the most important things, Al,

00:21:13.363 --> 00:21:17.897
is to make sure that central

00:21:17.930 --> 00:21:20.497
to this transformation,

00:21:20.497 --> 00:21:24.330
to this transition
to the new energy economy,

00:21:24.363 --> 00:21:27.563
central to it is environmental justice,

00:21:27.597 --> 00:21:32.163
is that we don't leave people behind,